# Drishti Workbench — configuration
#
# Copy to `.env` and adjust if your Ollama runs somewhere other than the
# default. This file lists every variable the application reads.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# There are NO API KEYS here, and there never will be.
#
# Drishti is air-gapped by design: it runs inside the plant network with no
# route to the internet. All model inference is served by a local Ollama
# daemon. If you ever find yourself adding OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY,
# GOOGLE_API_KEY or anything similar, stop — that is a design violation, not a
# missing feature. See the warning at the top of README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Base URL of the local Ollama daemon.
#   Running everything on the host:      http://localhost:11434
#   Running via docker-compose:          http://ollama:11434  (set for you)
OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
